  "rules_notes": [
    "Complete first-tap history records every actual battlefield tap since turn start, even before observer entry or under a different controller. ETB tapped, duplicates, already tapped objects and virtual funding are quiet.",
    "Intervening first-tap condition is checked at trigger and resolution using the exact non-targeted event object. Source departure, control change or later ability removal does not revoke a queued packet.",
    "The Java watcher counts by physical UUID across zone changes. CR400.7 requires a new object after departure/reentry, so Rust keys history by exact incarnation rather than reproducing that aliasing.",
    "Oracle and official release notes: https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/marvel-super-heroes-release-notes. No new catalogue identity or public wire field is required."
  ]
